        ]
      },
      "worked": "Given the first-round loss, Bob must win rounds 2 and 3. The required probability-tree path has branch probabilities $1-0.9=0.1$ and $0.7$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{Bob wins match}\\mid\\text{first-round loss})&=\\frac{1}{10}\\times\\frac{7}{10}\\\\P(\\text{Bob wins match}\\mid\\text{first-round loss})&=\\frac{7}{100}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
